[1.251, "o", "\u001b[2;5H\u001b[1mNovaFlow\u001b[m  work\r\r\n\u001b[15C / novaflow\u001b[6;5HAI Engineer\u001b[K\r\r\n \u001b[4P\u001b[9;5Hhighlights\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[6C- Architected the agent orchestration layer for an agentic bioinformatics platform,\u001b[11;9Himplementing a code-as-context pattern where an LLM agent plans, generates, and\r\r\n\u001b[6C  executes analysis code against genomics data (FASTQ, scRNA-seq up to 1TB+) while\u001b[13;9Hkeeping raw data out of the model context window.\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[6C- Built backend Modal integration provisioning ephemeral spot GPU compute for on-demand\u001b[16;9Hmodel inference and sandboxed code execution, cutting compute cost ~70% via preemptible\u001b[17;9Hinstances with async job queues and automatic retry/checkpointing.\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[6C- Engineered end-to-end ML pipeline over Postgres + S3 with Langfuse observability,\u001b[20;9Hintegrating Anthropic tool-use and semantic embeddings to translate natural-language\u001b[21;9Hqueries into reproducible single-cell analyses (Scanpy UMAP, KEGG pathway mapping).\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[4Clinks\r\r\n\u001b[6CCompany LinkedIn\r\r\n\u001b[6Chttps://www.linkedin.com/co"]
